<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Comerci upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Comerci upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flemings Research said Wednesday it had upgraded Mexican retail chain Controladora Comercial Mexicana (Comerci) to buy from hold in the wake of &quot;solid&quot; first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>Analyst Marc de Speville wrote in a research report that Comerci's first quarter earnings showed sales were beginning to recover and that the valuation gap with peers was &quot;excessive.&quot;</p>
<p>De Speville calculated the stock was trading at 9.7 times 1997 full-year cash flow, or appreciably below competitors.</p>
<p>((--Martin Roberts, Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-7907))</p>
